<title>SOUTH KOREA: Two S.Korean flour firms seek 22,500T of wheat.</title>
<headline>Two S.Korean flour firms seek 22,500T of wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Dongah Flour Mills Co Ltd and Cheiljedang Corp on Friday invited tenders for a total of 22,500 tonnes of U.S. wheat, traders said.  </p>
<p>Of the total, Cheiljedang invited tenders for 11,000 tonnes at basis over December futures on the Chicago Board of Trade, they said.</p>
<p>Shipment was set for December 10-January 10 to the western city of Inchon.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
